     "url": "https://rollcall.com/2026/10/05/as-congress-leans-on-pro-formas-bills-become-law-without-trump-signature/",
     "text": "The two laws were enacted through what’s known as the “10-day rule.” The Constitution says that bills become law after 10 days, excluding Sundays, without a presidential signature — as long as Congress has not adjourned. Pro formas, brief meetings of the House or Senate during which business is not usually conducted, allow the chambers to stay in session.",
